DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at
	 no extra cost to you. \nGet Tickets \nAbout the Show\nHigh Line Comedy Cl
	ub brings together top stand-up comedians and a one-of-a-kind mini-golf ex
	perience under one roof on Manhattan’s West Side. Featuring comics seen on
	 Netflix\, HBO\, Comedy Central\, The Tonight Show\, The Late Show\, and T
	he Daily Show\, this is NYC’s most unique comedy night out. \nTucked insid
	e an immersive mini-golf venue\, High Line Comedy Club is a hidden gem in 
	the city’s comedy scene — combining rooftop views\, a fantastic food menu\
	, and high-energy live performances night after night. \nEvent Details\nDa
	te: July 10\, 2026 and ongoing (select dates during purchase)\nTime: 7:00 
