SUMMARY:James Austin Johnson LIVE at Cobb's Comedy Club
DTSTAMP:20260710T043046Z
DTSTART:20260710T193000Z
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets\nResale Tickets \nJames Austin Johnson LIVE at Cobb’s Comedy Club\nO
	ne of the most buzzed-about comedians in the country\, James Austin Johnso
	n brings his extraordinary impressions and stand-up comedy to Cobb’s Comed
	y Club in San Francisco. Best known for his uncanny portrayals of Donald T
	rump and other public figures on Saturday Night Live\, JAJ delivers a live
	 show that is equal parts hilarious and jaw-dropping. \nEvent Details\nDat
	e: Friday\, July 10\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM (Doors open at 6:30 PM)\nVenue: 
	Cobb’s Comedy Club\nAddress: 915 Columbus Avenue\, San Francisco\, CA 9413
	3\nAge Requirement: 18+ with valid government-issued photo ID\nBeverage Mi
	nimum: 2-item minimum per person \nAbout James Austin Johnson\nJames Austi
	n Johnson is a comedian and impressionist best known as a cast member on S
	aturday Night Live\, where he became famous for his spot-on impression of 
	Donald Trump. Beyond his SNL fame\, JAJ is a gifted stand-up comedian with
	 a unique voice and a talent for character work that sets him apart from h
	is peers. His live shows are a must-see for comedy fans. \nWhat to Expect\
	n\nWorld-class impressions and stand-up comedy from an SNL fan favorite\nH
	ilarious character work and original material\nAn intimate club atmosphere
	 at one of SF’s premier comedy venues\nFull bar and food service available
	 throughout the show\nGeneral admission seating — arrive early for the bes
	t spots\nA night of non-stop laughs you won’t soon forget\n\nVenue Informa
	tion\nCobb’s Comedy Club is one of San Francisco’s most beloved comedy ven
	ues\, located in the vibrant North Beach neighborhood at 915 Columbus Aven
	ue. With a capacity of around 400\, it offers an intimate yet energetic at
	mosphere perfect for live stand-up comedy\, with full bar and food service
