DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nLiz Miele
	 is a New York-based stand-up comedian\, writer\, and podcaster known for 
	her sharp wit\, self-deprecating humor\, and fearlessly honest storytellin
	g. \nWith multiple comedy specials under her belt and years of touring exp
	erience\, Miele has built a devoted following for her relatable\, intellig
	ent\, and laugh-out-loud funny material. Her comedy covers everything from
	 relationships and anxiety to pop culture and everyday absurdities. \nShe 
	is also the host of the popular podcast Hysterical\, where she explores co
	medy and mental health. Liz Miele is a rising force in stand-up and this S
	an Francisco run is not to be missed. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Friday\, Ju
	ly 10\, 2026\nShow Time: 7:30 PM (Doors open approximately 1 hour prior)\n
	Venue: Punch Line Comedy Club — 444 Battery Street\, San Francisco\, CA 94
	111\nAge Requirement: 18+ with valid photo ID\nBeverage Minimum: 2 drinks 
	per person required\n\nAbout the Venue\nThe Punch Line Comedy Club in San 
	Francisco is one of the most iconic comedy clubs on the West Coast\, locat
	ed at 444 Battery Street in the Financial District. \nFounded in 1978\, th
	e Punch Line has launched the careers of countless comedy legends and cont
	inues to be a premier destination for stand-up comedy in the Bay Area. The
	 intimate room seats approximately 300 guests and offers an up-close\, per
	sonal experience with the performers. \nThe venue features a full bar\, ta
	ble seating\, and a two-drink minimum per person. Parking is available in 
	nearby lots and on the street. The Punch Line is easily accessible by BART
	 and Muni\, making it a convenient night out in the heart of San Francisco
	. \nWhat to Expect\nExpect an evening of sharp\, witty\, and deeply relata
	ble stand-up comedy from one of the most talented voices in the game today
	. \nLiz Miele’s live shows are known for their warmth\, intelligence\, and
	 genuine connection with the audience. She brings a conversational style t
	hat makes every show feel personal and spontaneous. \nThe show runs approx
	imately 75 minutes. Arrive early to grab a drink and get a great seat in t
	his intimate venue. Multiple shows are available throughout the weekend\, 
	so check the schedule for the time that works best for you. \nTicket Infor
	mation\nTickets are priced from approximately $25 – $48 (before fees). \nS
	ecure your seats now before they sell out: \nOfficial TicketsResale Ticket
	s \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no ext
	ra cost to you.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/liz-miele-live-at-punc
	h-line-comedy-club-san-francisco/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
