	esort
DTSTAMP:20260710T043046Z
DTSTART:20260710T220000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate l
	inks. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Perfor
	mer\nDeRay Davis is one of the most electrifying stand-up comedians workin
	g today — a Chicago-born powerhouse whose high-energy performances\, sharp
	 storytelling\, and magnetic stage presence have made him a fan favorite a
	cross the country. Known for his roles in films like 21 Jump Street\, Barb
	ershop\, and How High\, DeRay has built a reputation as both a gifted acto
	r and a fearless stand-up comedian. \nHis comedy is raw\, real\, and relen
	tlessly funny — drawing from his own life experiences growing up in Chicag
	o\, navigating Hollywood\, and finding humor in the everyday chaos of mode
	rn life. DeRay Davis brings an infectious energy to every performance that
	 leaves audiences laughing from the moment he hits the stage. \nThis one-n
	ight-only show at the Palazzo Theatre at The Venetian Resort is a rare cha
	nce to see DeRay Davis live in Las Vegas — don’t miss it. \nEvent Details\
	n\nDate: Friday\, July 10\, 2026\nTime: 10:00 PM\nVenue: Palazzo Theatre a
	t The Venetian Resort\nAddress: 3355 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las Vegas\, NV 891
	09\nNote: One night only\n\nAbout the Venue\nThe Palazzo Theatre at The Ve
	netian Resort is one of Las Vegas’s premier entertainment venues\, located
	 inside the iconic Venetian Resort at 3355 S Las Vegas Blvd. The theater s
	eats approximately 1\,800 guests and is renowned for its intimate atmosphe
	re\, excellent sightlines\, and world-class production capabilities. \nThe
	 Palazzo Theatre has hosted some of the biggest names in stand-up comedy\,
	 including Brian Regan\, Mark Normand\, Iliza Shlesinger\, and many more. 
	Its mid-size format makes it the perfect venue for a high-energy comedy sh
	ow — close enough to feel the performer’s energy\, large enough to create 
	an electric crowd atmosphere. \nValet and self-parking are available at Th
	e Venetian Resort. The resort offers world-class dining\, shopping\, and c
	asino entertainment\, making it easy to turn a DeRay Davis show into a ful
	l Las Vegas night out. \nWhat to Expect\nThis is a solo stand-up performan
	ce by DeRay Davis — one night only at the Palazzo Theatre. Expect a high-e
	nergy\, no-holds-barred comedy show packed with hilarious stories\, sharp 
	observations\, and the kind of raw\, authentic humor that has made DeRay D
	avis one of the most exciting comedians on the circuit today. \nDeRay Davi
	s’s live shows are known for their incredible energy and the deep connecti
	on he builds with his audience. Whether you’re a longtime fan or discoveri
	ng him for the first time\, this is a show you won’t want to miss. \nTicke
	t Information\nPrice Range: $30 – $150 \nTickets go on sale March 13\, 202
	6. Available through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale). \nOf
	ficial TicketsResale Tickets\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/deray-dav
	is-live-palazzo-theatre-venetian-las-vegas-july/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/deray-davis-live-palazzo-theatre-venet
	ian-las-vegas-july/
LOCATION:Palazzo Theatre at The Venetian Resort\, 3355 S Las Vegas Blvd\, L
	as Vegas\, NV\, 89109\, USA
