SUMMARY:Chris D'Elia LIVE at Brea Improv (Saturday Show)
DTSTAMP:20260710T043046Z
DTSTART:20260711T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout Chris D’Elia\nChris D’El
	ia is one of the most in-demand stand-up comedians working today. Known fo
	r his high-energy performances\, razor-sharp wit\, and fearless crowd work
	\, D’Elia has built a massive following through his Netflix specials — inc
	luding Man on Fire (2017)\, Incorrigible (2015)\, and his appearance in Ne
	tflix’s Comedians of the World series. His debut special White Male\, Blac
	k Comic premiered on Comedy Central in 2013. Beyond stand-up\, D’Elia is a
	 beloved podcast host — his show Congratulations with Chris D’Elia has bee
	n a top comedy podcast on iTunes since 2017. He’s also a co-star on The Go
	lden Hour with Brendan Schaub. \nWhat to Expect\nA Chris D’Elia show is an
	 experience unlike any other. Expect rapid-fire delivery\, hilarious perso
	nal stories\, and spontaneous crowd interaction that keeps the entire room
	 on edge. D’Elia’s comedy blends self-deprecating humor with bold observat
	ions about relationships\, pop culture\, and everyday life. His energy is 
	electric — he rarely stays still on stage — and his ability to improvise a
	nd riff with the audience makes every show feel completely unique. Saturda
	y night at the Brea Improv means a packed house and an electric atmosphere
	. This is a 21+ event\, so expect a mature\, no-holds-barred performance. 
	\nAbout Brea Improv\nThe Brea Improv is one of Southern California’s premi
	er comedy clubs\, located at 180 S Brea Blvd in Brea\, CA — just 30 miles 
	southeast of downtown Los Angeles. Part of the nationally renowned Improv 
	Comedy Club chain\, the Brea location features an intimate showroom with g
	eneral admission seating\, premium booths\, and a full food and beverage m
	enu. The club has a mandatory two-item minimum per guest in the showroom\,
	 making it a true dinner-and-a-show experience. With its cozy atmosphere a
	nd excellent sightlines\, every seat feels close to the stage. \nEvent Det
	ails\n\nDate: Saturday\, July 11\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM PDT (Doors open at 
	5:30 PM)\nVenue: Brea Improv\, 180 S Brea Blvd\, Brea\, CA 92821\nAge Requ
	irement: 21+\nTicket Prices: $35 – $100 (plus fees)\n\nOfficial TicketsRes
	ale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission
	 at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/chris-delia-
	live-at-brea-improv-saturday-show/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/chris-delia-live-at-brea-improv-saturd
	ay-show/
LOCATION:Brea Improv\, 180 South Brea Blvd\, Brea\, CA\, 92821\, United Sta
	tes
