	 Fallsview Casino\nAmerica’s Got Talent winner Terry Fator brings his spec
	tacular Pure Imagination show to the OLG Stage at Fallsview Casino. Combin
	ing ventriloquism\, singing\, comedy\, and impressions\, Fator delivers a 
	one-of-a-kind entertainment experience that has captivated audiences world
	wide. \nEvent Details\nDate: Saturday\, July 11\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM\nVen
	ue: OLG Stage at Fallsview Casino\nAddress: 6366 Stanley Ave\, Niagara Fal
	ls\, ON L2G 3Y5 \nAbout Terry Fator\nTerry Fator is the winner of America’
	s Got Talent Season 2 and one of the most successful entertainers in Las V
	egas history. His unique blend of ventriloquism\, singing\, comedy\, and c
	elebrity impressions has earned him a massive following and a long-running
	 Las Vegas residency. \nWhat to Expect\n\nWorld-class ventriloquism and ce
	lebrity impressions\nHilarious comedy and musical performances\nA spectacu
	lar one-of-a-kind entertainment experience\nA world-class venue at Fallsvi
	ew Casino\nAn unforgettable night of entertainment\n\nVenue Information\nT
	he OLG Stage at Fallsview Casino is a premier entertainment venue at 6366 
	Stanley Ave in Niagara Falls\, Ontario. \nTicket Information\nTickets star
	t at $75. Get your seats now! \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis po
	st contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets 
	through our links at no extra cost to you.\nAll sales are final. Show time
	s subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.\n\nhttps://
	comedycalendar.com/event/terry-fator-pure-imagination-live-at-olg-stage-at
	-fallsview-casino/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
